  (descr "Hirose FH34SRJ-12S-0.5SH(50), 12 contacts, 0.5 mm pitch, 1.0 mm tall, back-flip ZIF, top and bottom contact. Land pattern from the Hirose datasheet (Aug 2019, p.4): signal pads 0.3 x 0.8, mounting pads 0.4 x 0.8, E=7.1, F=7.9, 3.3 from signal pad edge to mounting pad edge. FPC inserts from the mounting-tab side (+Y); the signal pads are at the back (actuator side). Check against the datasheet before ordering.")
